       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STISET1.
      * STATEMENT INTEREST - STEP 1 RUN FLAG
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY STIFLG1.
       01  WS-CYCLE-DAY              PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-CYCLE-DAY
           IF WS-CYCLE-DAY = 1
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-STMT-INT-RUN
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'RUN: ' WS-STMT-INT-RUN
           STOP RUN.
